###Mapping
Mapping test::easterncove::mapping::CoveCrossMapping
(
  include mapping test::easterncove::mapping::CoveMapping
  include mapping test::easterncove::mapping::InboundVesselM2M

  test::easterncove::domain::VesselBerth: XStore
  {
    assignedBerth[vessel_set, berth]: $this.berthCode == $that.berthCode,
    vessel[berth, vessel_set]: $this.berthCode == $that.berthCode
  }
)
